<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="tracera-diagram-gen" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="17-google-sign-in" name="Google sign-in through Supabase Auth"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="frame" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1600" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="titlebar" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FF6B35;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="26" width="56" height="5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Google sign-in through Supabase Auth&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=26;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="36" width="1520" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="The access token that returns to the browser is never trusted: the server asks Supabase who it belongs to, then starts its own session." style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="74" width="1520" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a0" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Sign-in page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The web app asks GET /auth/providers. If Google is enabled it shows Continue with Google, a link to the Supabase authorize URL with redirect_to set to its own /auth/callback." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Google consent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The browser goes to the Supabase Auth project and on to Google. Supabase redirects back to /auth/callback with an access token in the URL fragment (implicit grant)." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="&lt;b&gt;3  Callback page&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The web app reads access_token from the fragment, removes the answer from the address bar and the history, and sends only the access token. A refresh token never reaches the server." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="812" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;4  POST /api/v1/auth/google&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Same CSRF header and Origin check as the password login. Failed attempts count against the per-address login limit, 10 a minute." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="125" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b0" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Ask the provider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The API calls Supabase GET /auth/v1/user with the token: 8 s timeout, redirects refused. Nothing in the token is trusted." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b1" value="&lt;b&gt;6  Decide&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The account must have been created through Google, and its Google identity must carry the same email, confirmed by Google. Otherwise 401 or 403." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="426" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b2" value="&lt;b&gt;7  Find or create the user&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The user with that email, or else a new member of the default workspace when TRACERA_GOOGLE_SIGNIN_NEW_USERS allows it. Never an owner. A new user has an unusable random password hash." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="812" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b3" value="&lt;b&gt;8  Session&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A sessions row (sha256 of the secret) and a tracera_session cookie: HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax, 7 days, Secure on https. The API then ends the Supabase session and writes audit events." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1198" y="365" width="360" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c0" value="&lt;b&gt;Configuration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, both required. Without them Google sign-in is off and the password form is the only way in." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="600" width="490" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b&gt;Refusals, all with stable codes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;invalid_provider_token 401, email_not_verified 403, signin_not_allowed 403, provider_unreachable 502, google_signin_unavailable 404. The page never shows text from the address or the response." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="600" width="490" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;After sign-in&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The session is the same as a password session: scoped to one workspace, with the same CSRF rule, token creation and owner-only actions." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="600" width="490" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t0" value="Web app or API step" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="860" width="147" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#A89888;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="251" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t1" value="Supabase and Google" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="293" y="860" width="147" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="462" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t2" value="Server decision" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="504" y="860" width="118" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="644" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t3" value="Notes" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="686" y="860" width="46" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t4" value="Next" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="860" width="39" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a0" target="a1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="a2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a2" target="a3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a3" target="b0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1360" y="335"/><mxPoint x="220" y="335"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b0" target="b1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b1" target="b2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b2" target="b3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="754" y="871" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="792" y="871" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
